Remember that the best lujvo is the one with the *lowest* score. So in 
jvozba, pick the one at the top of the list, which is tsirespa.

Here are some additional points I noticed:
When Oak asks you to enter your name, the window says "cmen", so I see 
it has a character limit of 4. How about using {me'e} there?
And then in the options menu, I would change jbini masno to masno jbini. 
The rest of the options menu seems good, but I would probably use barkla 
instead of barli'a, or just cliva by itself. It's not very important 
though, especially not at this point.

mu'o mi'e la selpa'i

